To run NEIGHCRYS, type
   cp NEIGHCRYS_input/* .
   neighcrys.out < neighcrys_answers

In order to use your NEIGHCRYS output files as DMACRYS input, change 'MOLE 0' to 'MOLE 1' in the PRIN line,
       add a line 'ACCM 100000000' after the CHGC line,
       change the STAR PLUT line to STAR PROP and remove the NOPR line

To run DMACRYS, type
   dmacrys.out < DCLBEN_beta_abi1.dmain > DCLBEN_beta_abi1.dmaout

To postprocess the DMACRYS result on Xenon, type
   /home/cposs/bin/FvibSetup_DMACRYS.pl < DCLBEN_beta_abi1.dmaout > fort.10
   /home/cposs/bin/elastphon.out
